From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Romulo Ruas <romulo.fernandes@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 18:21:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nvn_mtl: always enable CPU BC decompression and dispatch BC
 paths via function pointers

- CPU BC decompression is always enabled on GPUs without native BC support (no build-time or profile options needed)
- Eliminates runtime per-texture branch checks by binding specialized function pointers at launch time across concrete paths:
  1. Direct BC decompression via GPU (hardware BC)
  2. BC -> standard CPU decode (BC6H to RGBA16Float)

Upstream-Status: fork-only (declined seedds/nxnative#488)
Reason: BC textures on GPUs without BC support: always enable CPU decompression with launch-time dispatch
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#123
